e,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2026-05-29T19:01:08Z","updated_at":"2026-05-30T22:32:02Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n4.7 Beta 3 .NET\n\n### System information\n\nWin10\n\n### Issue description\n\nIf you use hotkeys+mouse to transform an object, the object will not transform if the transform gizmo is not in view.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1) Spawn CSGBox\n2) Click on CSG and look at CSG such that the transform gizmo is visible in the editor viewport.\n3) Use hotkeys to select the transform mode (translate,rotate,scale), then move mouse to select values. It should work fine.\n4) Click on CSG and look away from the transform transform gizmo so that it's no longer visible in the editor viewport, like 180 degrees away.\n5) Use hotkeys to select the transform mode (translate,rotate,scale), then move mouse to select values. It doesn't work.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nMRP attached.\nMy hotkeys are G,R,S for translate, rotate, scale. Not sure if these hotkeys transfer in the MRP.\n\n[new.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/28406173/new.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119882/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/11